WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.266
Continuing their journey to Snowbelle City,

2
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:21.666
site of Ash's eighth Gym battle challenge,

3
00:00:21.733 --> 00:00:25.100
our heroes are exploring a nearby Pokémon Center.

4
00:00:27.233 --> 00:00:30.900
You know, I'd like to see what's going on with Ash and Greninja.

5
00:00:30.966 --> 00:00:33.500
I'd say it's time for an analysis.

6
00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:37.966
The future is now, thanks to science.

7
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.466
Clemontic Gear, on!

8
00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:44.500
Clembot?

9
00:00:45.433 --> 00:00:46.700
So cute!

10
00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.566
Pika!

11
00:00:48.633 --> 00:00:51.600
My new revolutionary analysis machine.

12
00:00:52.033 --> 00:00:53.866
I call it Clembot Mini.

13
00:00:56.266 --> 00:00:57.900
All right, Clembot Mini,

14
00:00:57.966 --> 00:01:00.600
the results of the analysis, if you please.

15
00:01:03.533 --> 00:01:06.733
Up until now, Greninja has shown changes three times.

16
00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:08.066
Huh?

17
00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:13.400
We also know those changes have occurred only when a battle is taking place.

18
00:01:13.733 --> 00:01:17.966
And during those battles, Greninja's appearance seems to resemble Ash.

19
00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:21.266
I believe that this is most likely deeply related

20
00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:24.400
to a psychological element between the two of them.

21
00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:25.866
Psychological?

22
00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.900
That's right. In other words, it's a mental change.

23
00:01:28.966 --> 00:01:31.000
And because they have the same responses,

24
00:01:31.066 --> 00:01:33.400
how they react and move starts to look alike.

25
00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:36.900
This is just like the thing Olympia told us, right?

26
00:01:37.433 --> 00:01:40.166
Its power will become greater and greater.

27
00:01:40.933 --> 00:01:42.900
However, I do know this.

28
00:01:42.966 --> 00:01:46.766
It will reach new heights that no one has ever seen before.

29
00:01:47.466 --> 00:01:50.900
And the two of you will reach those new heights together.

30
00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:53.166
That's it!

31
00:01:53.233 --> 00:01:56.400
That's what Olympia's prediction was referring to.

32
00:01:56.466 --> 00:02:00.966
Also, Olympia told you that Greninja was trying to earn your love.

33
00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:03.866
However, what this Froakie was yearning for

34
00:02:03.933 --> 00:02:05.866
was something much deeper.

35
00:02:06.633 --> 00:02:08.433
I have a word for that.

36
00:02:09.199 --> 00:02:10.500
That word is love.

37
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.966
So, maybe that's the reason for all the changes.

38
00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:18.400
Sawyer did say Pokémon and Trainers with deep bonds begin to look alike.

39
00:02:18.466 --> 00:02:20.700
Maybe that's what could be happening to you.

40
00:02:22.733 --> 00:02:26.100
So, I think it's time to prove my hypothesis!

41
00:02:31.966 --> 00:02:35.733
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

42
00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:39.766
♪ Knock me down, I'll just get up again ♪

43
00:02:39.833 --> 00:02:42.966
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

44
00:02:43.033 --> 00:02:44.866
♪ Pokémon ♪

45
00:02:44.933 --> 00:02:47.333
- ♪ Pokémon ♪
- ♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

46
00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.600
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

47
00:02:50.666 --> 00:02:52.600
♪ Pokémon ♪

48
00:02:52.666 --> 00:02:55.466
- ♪ Pokémon ♪
- ♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

49
00:03:12.566 --> 00:03:14.866
- Hey, what's this?
- Ninja?

50
00:03:14.933 --> 00:03:16.133
I'll show you.

51
00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.700
Clemontic Gear, on!

52
00:03:17.766 --> 00:03:19.133
Yay, part two!

53
00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:22.000
I call them Battle Pulse Meters.

54
00:03:22.933 --> 00:03:25.100
- Battle Pulse Meters?
- Pika?

55
00:03:25.166 --> 00:03:29.500
That's correct. They collect and display changes in brain waves, heart rate

56
00:03:29.566 --> 00:03:31.100
and other data during battle.

57
00:03:31.933 --> 00:03:35.100
Any changes Greninja experiences are recorded,

58
00:03:35.166 --> 00:03:37.933
as well as how they're reflected in you, Ash.

59
00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.600
Then let's give it all we've got. You ready?

60
00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:48.733
The time has come.

61
00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:50.766
Battling research, begin!

62
00:03:59.266 --> 00:04:01.333
There's no holding back, Ash.

63
00:04:01.566 --> 00:04:02.733
Hey, I never do.

64
00:04:03.166 --> 00:04:04.933
Greninja, use Cut!

65
00:04:05.533 --> 00:04:06.766
Ninja!

66
00:04:06.833 --> 00:04:08.433
Thunder Fang, now!

67
00:04:16.966 --> 00:04:19.899
- That was a strong move.
- Wait till you see this.

68
00:04:19.966 --> 00:04:21.533
Luxray, Wild Charge!

69
00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.733
Luxray!

70
00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.433
Greninja, Double Team!

71
00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.733
Now, Greninja, use Aerial Ace!

72
00:04:46.533 --> 00:04:50.133
- Hm. That was an excellent move.
- Oh, wow.

73
00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:53.133
Ash and Greninja are really tuned in to each other.

74
00:05:02.266 --> 00:05:05.200
Welcome to the Pokémon Center.

75
00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:09.133
Huh?

76
00:05:18.533 --> 00:05:20.333
Time-out! Time-out!

77
00:05:20.933 --> 00:05:22.566
I'm not seeing any changes.

78
00:05:22.633 --> 00:05:24.933
I guess it doesn't happen all the time.

79
00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.666
Neither of us has any idea what makes it happen.

80
00:05:28.966 --> 00:05:30.600
Right, Greninja?

81
00:05:32.033 --> 00:05:35.533
Maybe there's a piece of critical information we're overlooking.

82
00:05:36.033 --> 00:05:37.066
Huh?

83
00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:38.900
Pika?

84
00:05:39.966 --> 00:05:43.266
Whenever we meet, you're in the middle of a battle. Hi.

85
00:05:43.333 --> 00:05:46.400
- Hey, Alain.
- Interesting device you're wearing.

86
00:05:47.933 --> 00:05:51.733
Yeah. We were trying to figure out what's up with Greninja's power.

87
00:05:52.233 --> 00:05:54.466
But it looks like it won't happen today.

88
00:05:54.866 --> 00:05:56.733
There must be something we're missing.

89
00:05:57.166 --> 00:05:59.633
That's it. Let's you and I have a battle, Alain.

90
00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:03.133
That would be great. Then I can concentrate on the data.

91
00:06:04.166 --> 00:06:07.933
Hm. Right. I was hoping to battle Greninja again.

92
00:06:08.366 --> 00:06:11.766
So, in that case... Thanks for helping out, Luxray.

93
00:06:11.833 --> 00:06:12.666
Return.

94
00:06:14.366 --> 00:06:16.133
Take a little rest, Greninja.

95
00:06:19.733 --> 00:06:20.933
Put them right here.

96
00:06:21.933 --> 00:06:23.700
- Thanks.
- Thanks.

97
00:06:24.233 --> 00:06:25.966
I'll take good care of them.

98
00:06:28.766 --> 00:06:31.600
All right, Alain, what do you want to do while we wait?

99
00:06:31.866 --> 00:06:32.700
I'm not sure.

100
00:06:32.933 --> 00:06:36.400
You must have some other Pokémon with you besides Charizard, right?

101
00:06:36.966 --> 00:06:38.933
Yeah. In fact I do.

102
00:06:39.166 --> 00:06:43.100
Then let's have a battle until Greninja's rested and all ready to go.

103
00:06:43.166 --> 00:06:44.333
Pika, Pika!

104
00:06:45.633 --> 00:06:46.533
You're on.

105
00:06:50.433 --> 00:06:52.866
Noivern! I choose you!

106
00:06:59.333 --> 00:07:02.000
Pika?! Pikachu, Pika!

107
00:07:02.066 --> 00:07:05.133
Sorry, buddy. I wanted to give Noivern a turn, too.

108
00:07:06.066 --> 00:07:06.966
Pika! Pika.

109
00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.266
Noivern! Good luck!

110
00:07:09.333 --> 00:07:10.466
Battle hard!

111
00:07:10.533 --> 00:07:11.966
Metang, let's go!

112
00:07:15.866 --> 00:07:16.700
Metang.

113
00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.366
A Metang.

114
00:07:21.766 --> 00:07:26.100
Metang. The Iron Claw Pokémon, and the evolved form of Beldum.

115
00:07:26.433 --> 00:07:29.300
Metang is created from the union of two Beldum.

116
00:07:29.533 --> 00:07:34.133
When its two brains are joined together, its psychic power is increased.

117
00:07:34.433 --> 00:07:36.500
Metang is a powerful Pokémon.

118
00:07:36.566 --> 00:07:39.700
It will be a formidable opponent, no matter who it battles.

119
00:07:39.766 --> 00:07:40.633
Oh.

120
00:07:41.566 --> 00:07:43.200
It looks strong, all right.

121
00:07:44.466 --> 00:07:47.133
Okay, Noivern, let's go!

122
00:07:47.566 --> 00:07:48.566
All right then.

123
00:07:49.033 --> 00:07:51.566
Battle... begin!

124
00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.233
Now use Acrobatics!

125
00:08:02.666 --> 00:08:04.400
All right, Metal Claw!

126
00:08:04.466 --> 00:08:05.800
Metang!

127
00:08:08.033 --> 00:08:10.600
- Psyshock, let's go!
- Noivern, Boomburst!

128
00:08:17.066 --> 00:08:19.700
- Noivern's still battling hard.
- Supersonic!

129
00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.533
-The Supersonic's working!

130
00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.700
All right, use Acrobatics!

131
00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.466
Quick, Psyshock!

132
00:08:39.666 --> 00:08:42.333
-Now, Meteor Mash!

133
00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:44.366
Metang!

134
00:08:44.433 --> 00:08:45.600
Dodge it, quick!

135
00:08:51.066 --> 00:08:52.200
Boomburst, go!

136
00:08:59.866 --> 00:09:02.266
- All right, Metal Claw!
- Use Acrobatics!

137
00:09:19.733 --> 00:09:20.966
Pika, Pika!

138
00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:28.166
Huh?

139
00:09:29.333 --> 00:09:31.333
Noivern is unable to battle!

140
00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:33.366
Metang wins!

141
00:09:34.533 --> 00:09:37.300
- Noivern, are you okay?
- Pikachu!

142
00:09:38.266 --> 00:09:40.200
Noivern...

143
00:09:40.266 --> 00:09:43.833
Awesome. No doubt, this battle will make you even stronger.

144
00:09:44.466 --> 00:09:46.566
Noivern!

145
00:09:47.033 --> 00:09:50.466
Noivern battled really well against a whole lot of power.

146
00:09:50.533 --> 00:09:53.366
You're right. Noivern was so good.

147
00:09:54.233 --> 00:09:56.866
A little bit more time and we would've been beaten.

148
00:09:57.533 --> 00:09:58.500
Meta.

149
00:10:02.433 --> 00:10:03.866
Ash? Clemont?

150
00:10:03.933 --> 00:10:06.966
I'm happy to report your Pokémon are now fully recovered.

151
00:10:11.933 --> 00:10:13.566
So, that will tell you something?

152
00:10:13.633 --> 00:10:17.500
I think that the phenomenon between Ash and Greninja is psychological.

153
00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:22.900
The changes occur when their mental and emotional states are truly in sync.

154
00:10:23.966 --> 00:10:25.133
Truly in sync.

155
00:10:25.666 --> 00:10:27.033
We're all ready here.

156
00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:28.600
Let's do this!

157
00:10:28.666 --> 00:10:30.000
Greninja!

158
00:10:34.433 --> 00:10:35.900
Ninja.

159
00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:37.733
Greninja.

160
00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:40.133
Charizard, let's go!

161
00:10:44.433 --> 00:10:48.300
All right, we're all set. Battle begin!

162
00:10:51.933 --> 00:10:53.466
Okay, we'll go first.

163
00:10:54.233 --> 00:10:55.400
Water Shuriken!

164
00:10:57.633 --> 00:11:00.400
Move in, Charizard! Dragon Claw, go!

165
00:11:14.966 --> 00:11:16.833
Who's that Pokémon?

166
00:11:22.433 --> 00:11:24.166
It's Metang!

167
00:11:24.233 --> 00:11:25.700
Metang!

168
00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:31.666
Double Team, let's go!

169
00:11:33.266 --> 00:11:35.466
Use Flamethrower! Knock them down!

170
00:11:43.866 --> 00:11:45.100
Now use Cut!

171
00:11:54.066 --> 00:11:55.566
Way to go, Greninja!

172
00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:02.700
It's only right to use the massive power we possess to face them in battle.

173
00:12:03.433 --> 00:12:04.800
Respond to my heart.

174
00:12:05.233 --> 00:12:06.100
Key Stone!

175
00:12:06.166 --> 00:12:07.633
Beyond Evolution!

176
00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.000
Mega Evolve!

177
00:12:30.533 --> 00:12:31.366
Yeah.

178
00:12:32.166 --> 00:12:35.233
All right. Let's see if we can trigger that change.

179
00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:37.166
Charizard, use Thunder Punch!

180
00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:39.900
Aerial Ace!

181
00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:53.066
- Look at that.
- Anything, Clemont?

182
00:12:53.833 --> 00:12:55.733
I'm not seeing any changes yet.

183
00:12:56.033 --> 00:12:57.166
Now, use Cut!

184
00:12:59.933 --> 00:13:01.200
Grab it!

185
00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.400
Now, Flamethrower!

186
00:13:12.033 --> 00:13:13.400
Next, Thunder Punch!

187
00:13:15.566 --> 00:13:17.033
Use Water Shuriken!

188
00:13:24.266 --> 00:13:25.433
Ninja...

189
00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.133
Greninja. You can still battle, right?

190
00:13:36.266 --> 00:13:38.533
-Yeah, that's the spirit!

191
00:13:45.066 --> 00:13:46.500
Huh?

192
00:13:51.033 --> 00:13:52.500
It's starting to happen.

193
00:13:53.566 --> 00:13:55.000
There's the overlap!

194
00:13:56.300 --> 00:14:00.066
- Clemont, what does it mean?
- They're beginning synchronization.

195
00:14:00.466 --> 00:14:02.066
Gotta get strong. Strong!

196
00:14:03.266 --> 00:14:04.266
Let's go!

197
00:14:11.233 --> 00:14:13.300
- Totally in sync.
- Pika, Pika!

198
00:14:13.366 --> 00:14:15.266
- It started.
- All right!

199
00:14:20.733 --> 00:14:25.266
So, that means my hypothesis is correct. In order for the change to take effect,

200
00:14:25.333 --> 00:14:28.033
Ash and Greninja's emotions must be in sync.

201
00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:30.966
Greninja! Let's go!

202
00:14:38.433 --> 00:14:39.500
Use Cut!

203
00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:41.833
Ninja!

204
00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:43.600
Heads up.

205
00:14:44.933 --> 00:14:45.766
Dodge it!

206
00:14:48.733 --> 00:14:50.200
Flamethrower, let's go!

207
00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:55.300
Use Cut!

208
00:14:57.566 --> 00:14:59.266
All right! Aerial Ace!

209
00:14:59.333 --> 00:15:00.633
Intercept it.

210
00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:01.933
Use Thunder Punch!

211
00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:11.100
Now, go!

212
00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.000
Oh, yes!

213
00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:21.433
This... This is what I've been waiting for.

214
00:15:21.733 --> 00:15:25.833
Can you feel it like I can? Can you feel all their incredible power yet?

215
00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:29.633
-All right, let's really ramp it up.

216
00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:30.933
Use Cut!

217
00:15:32.366 --> 00:15:33.533
Dragon Claw, go!

218
00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:51.433
Use Cut one more time!

219
00:16:00.366 --> 00:16:01.433
Charizard!

220
00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.400
What's wrong with Ash?

221
00:16:14.733 --> 00:16:15.633
Pika?

222
00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:20.466
The graph. It seems Ash and Greninja's battle pulses are separating!

223
00:16:20.533 --> 00:16:21.866
-Pika?

224
00:16:21.933 --> 00:16:24.333
- What does that mean?
- What's happening?

225
00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:26.466
What's happening? What's happening...?

226
00:16:28.366 --> 00:16:29.366
I can't move.

227
00:16:30.533 --> 00:16:31.533
What's going on?

228
00:16:33.433 --> 00:16:34.366
What...?

229
00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:41.833
-Ash, no!

230
00:16:43.166 --> 00:16:44.000
Ash!

231
00:16:51.333 --> 00:16:52.400
Ash!

232
00:16:52.466 --> 00:16:53.466
Ash!

233
00:17:00.133 --> 00:17:01.166
Greninja.

234
00:17:01.733 --> 00:17:03.166
What's happened to us?

235
00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.566
I can't move.

236
00:17:08.733 --> 00:17:09.566
Wait.

237
00:17:10.033 --> 00:17:11.300
Don't go, Greninja.

238
00:17:11.866 --> 00:17:13.033
Greninja!

239
00:17:15.166 --> 00:17:16.200
Pika!

240
00:17:16.266 --> 00:17:18.366
- He's waking up.
- Hey, Ash.

241
00:17:18.433 --> 00:17:20.866
- Ash, are you all right?
- Huh?

242
00:17:25.099 --> 00:17:26.200
Thank goodness.

243
00:17:26.266 --> 00:17:27.800
You had me so worried.

244
00:17:28.433 --> 00:17:31.566
- Sorry.
- You take it easy for the rest of the day.

245
00:17:31.633 --> 00:17:32.533
Mm-hm.

246
00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:35.800
- Sorry I messed up our battle.
- Hm. Don't worry about it.

247
00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:37.233
You know...

248
00:17:37.766 --> 00:17:40.400
I couldn't move, no matter what I did.

249
00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:45.366
Synchronizing to that degree could definitely put a heavy load on a Trainer.

250
00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:47.866
That doesn't surprise me at all.

251
00:17:49.266 --> 00:17:52.333
I've never witnessed that kind of raw power before.

252
00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:59.600
But why couldn't I move my body?

253
00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:04.033
Alain. If we can learn to control that power,

254
00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:05.400
I wanna battle again.

255
00:18:05.833 --> 00:18:09.566
The reality is... our battle hasn't been decided yet.

256
00:18:10.766 --> 00:18:11.700
Hmm.

257
00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:15.133
I'll train hard and get strong enough to beat you,

258
00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:19.400
and then I'll win the Kalos League. I'll be a Pokémon Master someday.

259
00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:21.466
Really? Kalos League?

260
00:18:21.533 --> 00:18:25.633
- You're gonna enter, too, right, Alain?
- I'm not. Not really.

261
00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:31.366
Why not? All of the strongest Pokémon and Trainers in the entire Kalos region

262
00:18:31.433 --> 00:18:34.300
are gonna be there. I'm so psyched!

263
00:18:36.533 --> 00:18:37.866
It sounds like fun.

264
00:18:46.633 --> 00:18:50.600
Everything's fine here. I'll keep researching Mega Evolution and--

265
00:18:50.666 --> 00:18:51.700
- Hold on.
- Huh?

266
00:18:51.766 --> 00:18:54.633
A new video from Lysandre has just arrived.

267
00:18:55.533 --> 00:18:56.433
Huh?

268
00:18:56.966 --> 00:18:58.966
Hi, Alain. I've got good news.

269
00:19:00.066 --> 00:19:02.866
Chespie's spines just moved a little while ago.

270
00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:08.500
Not a whole lot, but they did. I thought you'd wanna know.

271
00:19:09.833 --> 00:19:11.400
Everything's fine here.

272
00:19:11.466 --> 00:19:12.800
Bye! Good luck!

273
00:19:15.066 --> 00:19:17.933
That's all. Continue with your mission.

274
00:19:20.233 --> 00:19:22.533
So, how did you like the battle with Ash?

275
00:19:25.533 --> 00:19:29.300
It really brought me back. Thinking about my time with the professor.

276
00:19:31.133 --> 00:19:33.200
Let's get stronger, too.

277
00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:37.133
If we don't... then we can't protect the ones we love.

278
00:19:43.733 --> 00:19:44.966
Hmm.

279
00:19:45.033 --> 00:19:46.633
I'm gonna become Greninja.

280
00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:49.066
- Huh?
- Pika, Pika?

281
00:19:49.133 --> 00:19:51.566
I just mean, I'm gonna get really strong.

282
00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:55.100
Until now, I thought about getting my Pokémon strong.

283
00:19:55.566 --> 00:19:57.833
Now it's my turn to get strong, too.

284
00:19:58.366 --> 00:20:00.366
I've gotta do it. No doubt.

285
00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:03.733
Like Olympia said, Greninja and I are gonna reach

286
00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:05.500
new heights of power together.

287
00:20:05.933 --> 00:20:08.700
- What do you say we do what she says?
- Ninja!

288
00:20:08.766 --> 00:20:12.366
- That sounds like you, all right.
- I'll need lots of energy.

289
00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:14.300
It's marathon time!

290
00:20:14.366 --> 00:20:16.000
-Pikachu!

291
00:20:16.066 --> 00:20:17.600
We'll all do it together.

292
00:20:23.966 --> 00:20:26.066
Okay, everybody, let's go.

293
00:20:26.433 --> 00:20:28.333
-Hey, wait for me!

294
00:20:28.533 --> 00:20:31.900
- Come on, Clemont, hurry!
- You're not serious! Wait!

295
00:20:31.966 --> 00:20:33.666
Not so fast! Come on!

296
00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:36.966
Will Ash really be able to become like Greninja?

297
00:20:37.033 --> 00:20:39.466
This special training is only the beginning.

298
00:20:39.533 --> 00:20:42.300
With Ash's Snowbelle Gym battle just ahead,

299
00:20:42.366 --> 00:20:45.600
the challenge and the journey continues.
